 #!/usr/bin/env python3
-"""Short isolated Knots net: pool node + 2 honest + a proxy of the pool's templates.
-Posts snapshots to primed (PRIME_STATS). Ports from argv. No miners.
+"""XBT-064 fake-DATUM detector on real Knots 29.4.2 regtest nodes with converged mempools.
+
+Isolated, loopback only, ports BASE..BASE+7 (default 30520), datadirs under $XBT064_RUN.
+No miner processes: blocks come from generatetodescriptor on whichever node "finds" them.
+
+  P   the pool's node (Prime's)
+  H1  honest gateway node, peers P
+  H2  honest gateway node, peers P and H1
+  X   the node the fake gateway registered (it runs, relays, and is ignored by its gateway)
+
+Gateways, polled every 0.5 s (getblocktemplate) as Prime would see their jobs:
+  knots-h1, knots-h2  their own node's template (same policy as P, same mempool: near-identical)
+  knots-proxy         P's template 20-80 ms later            (canaries go to X)
+  knots-mimic         P's template reordered, 0.3-1.5 s later (canaries go to X)
+
+Traffic: P2WSH(OP_TRUE) spends; a share XBT064_TO_POOL (default 1.0) enters at P, the rest at
+H1/H2/X. At 1.0 every honest mempool is the pool's (plus the canaries): the case that made the
+similarity detector flag honest gateways.
+Blocks: every 8-14 s from P (50 %), H1 or H2 (25 % each, "other miners").
+Canaries: every 2 s per gateway, Prime (this script) builds a conflicting pair from one
+confirmed UTXO: C (to the gateway's registered node) and C' (1 sat more fee, to P). Neither
+can replace the other (BIP125 needs +incremental relay fee), so first-seen partitions the
+network: the gateway's node holds C, P and whoever hears from it first hold C'. P also gets
+`prioritisetransaction C 0 -100000000` before C exists, so P can never template C. A gateway
+built from P's template (or from any node that heard C' first) cannot carry C.
+XBT064_CANARY_EVERY=0 turns canaries off (control run: nothing may be flagged). Snapshots and canaries are posted to primed (PRIME_STATS); primed's verdict is
+asserted: the honest gateways are not flagged, proxy and mimic are.
+
+Usage: rnd-a2-knots.py <bitcoind> [seconds] [base_port]
 """
